        "created_at": "2015-01-12T19:48:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For those who might not have seen, I posted the results of the Kingdom of Wisdom promo deck that PW, jsz2, and I worked out over at the 'Geek last night. I think we did a pretty good job, as evidenced by a pair of thumbs and no feedback. However, it might still have some rough spots.</p><p>And if you haven't ever read the Phantom Tollbooth, you owe it to yourself to go do so right now.</p>",
